<title>DENMARK: FLS buys American Concrete Products.</title>
<headline>FLS buys American Concrete Products.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's FLS Industries group said on Monday that its Unicon Beton cement unit had purchased U.S. producer American Concrete Products.</p>
<p>It did not disclose the terms of the deal but said in a statement that the acquisition was expected to bring its U.S. turnover to about 540 million crowns in 1997, doubling its present activity.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33 969650</p>
</text>
